Revision history for Layout-Flex

0.06    2026-10-05
	- Find the installed fm.h under @INC rather than trusting the -I paths
	  ExtUtils::Depends carries over from Font::Metrics, which name that
	  distribution's deleted build tree; fixes "fm.h: No such file or
	  directory" at compile time.
	- Die at configure time, naming fm.h, when the header is missing.

0.05    2026-07-24
	- Link Font::Metrics libfm.a static archive into Flex.so via LDFROM;
	  should hopefully fix undefined symbol fm_* errors on Linux at load time.
	- Require Font::Metrics >= 0.03.

0.04    2026-07-23
	- UTF-8 support in Font::Metrics measure path (is_utf8 branching in
	  lf_measure_fm and lf_measure_fm_wrapped).

0.03    2026-07-23
	- Integrate with Font::Metrics

0.01    2026-07-21
	- First version
